{
  "work": "Sun of Moscow is operated and ticketed as its own wheel and multifunctional complex beside the VDNKh South Entrance, outside the Orion amusement park. Five official-editor searches in English and Russian found no matching Park or Standalone record. The operator states 140 m height, thirty enclosed cabins, fifteen riders per cabin, five transparent floors and an 18m40s rotation; VDNKh confirms the September 2022 opening. Official tariff page distinguishes wheel hours from the complex footer: Monday-Friday 12:00-22:00; weekends 11:00-22:00. Ticket prices vary by day, holiday and cabin; no fixed price was asserted. Two exact 2025/2024 Commons photos were visually checked, imported and published. The first audit found duplicate photo alt/caption wording; both images were corrected in all eight languages and the final audit has no blockers. All eight locale pages and both image binaries returned HTTP 200 before Facebook publication.",
